1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,560
The tide is out!

2
00:00:01,660 --> 00:00:04,307
Grab everything that glitters

3
00:00:04,407 --> 00:00:05,921
A full bag slows you down

4
00:00:06,071 --> 00:00:08,878
Just one more…?

5
00:00:08,978 --> 00:00:12,021
Tide's coming. Run!

6
00:00:12,171 --> 00:00:14,821
Phew, made it!

7
00:00:15,021 --> 00:00:19,871
Build with what you bring back

8
00:00:20,071 --> 00:00:22,921
Reach places you couldn't before

9
00:00:23,021 --> 00:00:24,571
Until the empty island is a village

10
00:00:25,071 --> 00:00:27,121
Low Tide Island — One thumb. Back before the tide.
